Implement the `double_expr` macro to achieve the desired functionality.

### Solution:
```rust
macro_rules! double_expr {
    // Base case: for literal values
    ($val:literal) => {
        $val * 2
    };
    // Case for binary operations
    ($left:expr + $right:expr) => {
        double_expr!($left) + double_expr!($right)
    };
    ($left:expr - $right:expr) => {
        double_expr!($left) - double_expr!($right)
